  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion and capacity building of bioethics in the Arab region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to: 1) promote universal principles of bioethics among healthcare professionals, experts, general public, media, students and policy makers as well as to enhance capacity of experts to better address ethical issues surrounding health care and research, notably when involving women in the Arab Region. 2) Advance the ethics of science and technology through the dissemination and implementation of the Charter of Ethics of Science and Technology in the Arab Region.</narrative>
  </description>
